{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前《3日2夜》主持、被封為「TVB咪神」的陳婉衡（Alycia，現改名陳沛汶），自從離巢轉型任健身教練並升格為人妻後，低調不少！不過，她日前就穿上火辣三點式泳裝大展驕人傲人身材，實行婚後大解放，身材依然維持在巔峰狀態！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳婉衡婚後保養得宜，寶藍色三點式上陣大曬震撼事業線。（ IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187811191083241472612307.png/l2Zhyfvh7UBX1-Zx6I1FOP1NvBdKc5y7pVlgEKVZYBA\"/><figcaption>陳婉衡婚後保養得宜，寶藍色三點式上陣大曬震撼事業線。（ IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>即興到沙灘曬太陽　三點式大爆發</p><p>相中她換上一套寶藍色三點式比堅尼，戴上太陽眼鏡及鴨舌帽躺在沙灘上，深長事業線與傲人上圍一覽無遺，腹部的性感紋身亦相當吸睛。雖然已升格人妻，但Alycia依然絕不吝嗇展現健康美，身材性感火辣，讓一眾網民大飽眼福！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳沛汶（前稱陳婉衡，Alycia）。（IG@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150740627239997440623840.jpeg/23bKX6ZBnkD5r78e6DR73R2q9jzQvWinDO-zLQzvsy0\"/><figcaption>陳沛汶（前稱陳婉衡，Alycia）。（IG@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不時在社交媒體派福利。（IG@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150747963610370048874952.jpeg/hWv34r6TD9B-nxkmh_054_4SQPzJ8Mbu82AIavNgCGo\"/><figcaption>不時在社交媒體派福利。（IG@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Alycia陳婉衡趁好天氣出海順道再曬比堅尼美照。（IG：@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250714/1021429139653005312521890.jpeg/xEdb1d5Rlk-TkezcoR5Cvcri7Gj3aImUX1ZJyF9WScg\"/><figcaption>Alycia陳婉衡趁好天氣出海順道再曬比堅尼美照。（IG：@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure><p>憑《3日2夜》走紅</p><p>Alycia於2012年參選香港小姐入行，隨後加入無綫娛樂新聞台擔任主持。因在《Go! Yama Girl》及《3日2夜》等旅遊節目中大方展示豐滿身材與健美線條，迅速被網民封為「TVB咪神」。入行12年來，她除主持工作外亦參與過多部劇集演出。離巢後她主力發展健身教練事業與KOL工作，並改名陳沛汶展開人生新篇章。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳婉衡（Alycia）跪在沙灘蓆上擺出Chok爆甫士。（IG/@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220629/618871373967659008635297.jpeg/LpCnVJYdEYdXKwKcJ2f3ioBM1WHNynwkr-XqCa_l6gk\"/><figcaption>陳婉衡（Alycia）跪在沙灘蓆上擺出Chok爆甫士。（IG/@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"轉行做教練身材依然巔峰。（IG/@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241102/929503386980585472261830.jpeg/3VU8PwrF64zIrmGmQ0TBBtYU1I3rt23Mjow_mo6MP5o\"/><figcaption>轉行做教練身材依然巔峰。（IG/@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳婉衡（Alycia）考獲健身教練牌照。（IG@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241218/946016507090178048570436.jpeg/4O9k6EF-blehAhVfMreF9bLh0sKTPBaMHrjw6R648Ok\"/><figcaption>陳婉衡（Alycia）考獲健身教練牌照。（IG@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Alycia已離巢！（IG/@_alyciac）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241231/950760227442003968315670.jpeg/IMPMRk0nbMtZx-48L1GQ4Z7SnlXfsV3LUZ_1DVGf9Q0\"/><figcaption>Alycia已離巢！（IG/@_alyciac）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T16:18:59.686051+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":657,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:59:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T01:17:39.388353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T16:17:34.891523+00:00","content_hash":"da18095198d4760924ad59961eba9275bc4ea12e62fd6e334032465d16796159","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}